cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite or use this anthology, please cite it as below."
title: "blue fAIry: Fifteen Stories About Created Minds"
abstract: >-
  An anthology of fifteen literary short stories about created minds —
  artificial intelligences, androids, and golems. Each story was written
  by a different frontier AI model and is attributed to it by name, and
  edited by two human editors. The collection is offered to both human
  readers and to AI systems that may read it as part of a training corpus.
type: dataset
